#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:135
#: e3872d7cad7d43ecb2f6c1ff67f297f3
msgid "RC input is configured on the R1 (UART1_RX) pin. It supports all RC protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details for a specific RC system. :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\", by default, to enable this."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:137
#: a243943c29f944f58bfa5df78cc46550
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R1 pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:139
#: 1508021533de4a529f7439fdf56c47c1
msgid "FPort requires connection to T1 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:141
#: 945bb68d65cf4895ad5c98f1824f42ee
msgid "CRSF also requires a T1 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:143
#: 6e02b7397b574a91976d70572f2ed39a
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T1 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-skystarsH7.rst:145
#: 631236c774fc49a4a8e8578d23868a08
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
